invariant: INV-9
file: tls_write.c
catches: unit
reason: ch_write_parts keeps the byte count of the part it finished when it
  moves to the next part, so it skips the start of that part and seals
  bytes the caller did not pass. test_write_parts requires the wire bytes
  of ch_write over the joined parts.

--- old
        c->index++;
        c->offset = 0;
--- new
        c->index++;
